				<g class="diagram-node decision-node" data-node="model" data-index="05" data-title="模型生成 Thought / Action" data-detail="模型在每一步选择注册工具或返回 Finish；单回合最多执行 5 步。" data-files="agent.py · llm_client.py" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="05 模型决策"><rect x="475" y="150" width="110" height="64" rx="14"></rect><text x="489" y="170" class="node-index">05 · DECIDE</text><text x="530" y="193" class="node-label">模型决策</text></g>
